    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9417af4a6cfb4c2",
      "translationZh": "我每天使用 8+ 个 AI 编程智能体（Claude Code、Cursor、Windsurf、Codex 等），它们在不同会话之间都会失忆——更糟的是，它们彼此之间也不共享记忆。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a99a2597dd00abc9",
      "translationZh": "现有解决方案（mem0、Zep、Letta）都基于云端或服务器。我想要的是本地运行、极其简单的方案：只需让所有智能体都指向同一个 SQLite 文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72829a1d0a47c487",
      "translationZh": "于是我构建了 MemTether——一个通过文件级指针（目录联接/符号链接）工作的记忆中心。无需云端，无需 API 费用，也没有抽象层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c83bc5b6a26a716a",
      "translationZh": "23 个客户端适配器（自动检测并连接）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7acd598aae3491bc",
      "translationZh": "来源归属（知道每条记忆是由哪个智能体写入的）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8c57ff69a22d090",
      "translationZh": "双时态（实际成立的事实与系统当时已知的信息）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "431a88253ff2f3ee",
      "translationZh": "Q-Value 排序（被使用的记忆排名更高）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1505e8332c1c0e06",
      "translationZh": "FTS5 + 向量搜索（bge-m3，本地嵌入）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2de0487dbe0068a",
      "translationZh": "技术栈：Python、SQLite FTS5、ChromaDB、FastAPI。全部在本地运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
